    {
      "name": "02_du_n1",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "公元七五七年，长安城被叛军占领。杜甫困在城里，和家人断了音信。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "02_du_n1.mp3",
      "bytes": 119997,
      "heard": "公元七五七年长安城被叛军占领杜甫困在城里和家人断了阴性",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 7.44
    },
    {
      "name": "02_du_q",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "烽火连三月……家书抵万金。",
      "voice": "4VZIsMPtgggwNg7OXbPY",
      "voice_id": "4VZIsMPtgggwNg7OXbPY",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "02_du_q.mp3",
      "bytes": 66498,
      "heard": "风火连三月,家书抵万斤",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 4.08
    },
    {
      "name": "02_du_n2",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "那时候，一封信可能要走好几个月，也可能，永远到不了。",
      "voice": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "voice_id": "MI36FIkp9wRP7cpWKPTl",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "02_du_n2.mp3",
      "bytes": 95755,
      "heard": "那时候,依封信可能要走好几个月也可能,永远到不了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 5.92
    },
    {
      "name": "03_morse_n1",
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "[somber] In 1825, a painter named Samuel Morse was in Washington, painting a portrait of Lafayette. A letter from his father told him that his wife had died. [pause] By the time he got home… she had already been buried.",
